OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,6,Fand a few showers, which could be
OL,7,Fquite heavy in the west. Fresh to
OL,8,Fstrong west or southwest winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FMainly dry with clear spells
OL,11,Fthrough the evening and overnight but
OL,12,Fa few showers in the west. Fresh to
OL,13,Fstrong westerly winds will start to
OL,14,Fease through the early hours.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FMostly dry and bright with
OL,17,Fgood sunny spells, but somewhat
OL,18,Fcloudier in the afternoon with the
OL,19,Fchance of the odd shower. Fresh winds
OL,20,Fat first will become light by
OL,21,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
